Additional notice

This public repository contains documentation, classification metadata and
original tooling. It contains no game program code, no ROM image, no
byte-exact data section and no rebuilt ROM set. The MIT license above applies
only to the original tooling, documentation and other contributed material,
and grants no rights to any game content. The private working tree contains a
source reconstruction; that reconstruction is not distributed here.
